- a. Dose does not exceed 800 mg per infusion for up to 4 total doses;
- b. Dose is supported by practice guidelines or peer-reviewed literature for the relevant offflabel use (prescriber must submit supporting evidence).

*Prescribed regimen must be FDA-approved or recommended by NCCN

Approval duration: Up to 4 total doses

