2. Request is for Abrilada, adalimumab-aacf, adalimumab-aaty, adalimumab-adaz, adalimumab -adbm, adalimumab -bwwd, adalimumab -fkjp, adalimumab-ryvk, Amjevtia, Cyltezo, Hadlima, Hulio, Humira, Hyrimoz , Idacio, Simlandi, Yuflyma, or Yusimry;
